    {
      "id": "claim_3f33c4f69ae0462095cb6371ff84acbb",
      "statement": "The Makefile's `##@ Wiki` group has `make wiki` (generate openwiki/ from scratch, costs money), `make wiki-update` (refresh only pages whose source changed, no model call when nothing did) and `make wiki-fix MSG=...` (ask OpenWiki to correct pages; errors with a usage message when MSG is empty). All three run the pinned openwiki@0.7.2 via npx with the Anthropic provider set explicitly, source .env quietly, and delete openwiki/.run.json afterwards.",
