      "statement": "CLAUDE.md remains the source of repo invariants and commands; AGENTS.md is a pointer that sends agents to CLAUDE.md first and names docs/ARCHITECTURE.md (rules and decisions), openwiki/ (generated facts) and docs/CHANGELOG.md (what shipped). The OpenWiki wiki is optional just-in-time context: agents use openwiki_search/openwiki_read only when needed and fall back to openwiki/quickstart.md only when retrieval tools are unavailable, with source code and tests authoritative.",
